Updating the cluster-scoped resources for the platform and services (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-07-15

Before you upgrade the IBM Software Hub platform or services, you must create the cluster-scoped resources, such as the cluster roles and cluster role bindings, for the components in the instance that you plan to upgrade.

